<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SPANISH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SPANISH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of Spanish first</p>
<p>division soccer matches played on Sunday:</p>
<p>Barcelona 8 (Hristo Stoichkov 21, 55-penalty, Giovanni 30, 43,</p>
<p>Ronaldo 37, 89-penalty, David Clotet 75-own goal, Juan Pizzi 82)</p>
<p>Logrones 0. Halftime 4-0. Attendance 70,000.</p>
<p>Real Betis 3 (George Finidi 31, Pier Cherubino 62, Alfonso</p>
<p>Perez 77) Rayo Vallecano 0. 1-0. 43,000.</p>
<p>Celta Vigo 1 (Alvaro Cervera 60-own goal) Racing Santander</p>
<p>(David Billabona 70). 0-0. 18,000.</p>
<p>Valencia 3 (Antonio Poyatos 36, Goran Vlaovic 51, Claudio Lopez</p>
<p>89) Atletico Madrid 1 (Juan Eduardo Esnaider 87). 1-0. 49,000.</p>
</text>
